# This repository is rooted at the game's `mods/` directory, so that GitHub shows
# a `civilian_variety` folder which drops straight into any install without being
# renamed or unpacked twice.
#
# Everything at this level is therefore ignored by default and re-admitted
# explicitly. That way installing an unrelated third-party mod into this folder
# never shows up in `git status`, and the game's own
# `put-your-third-party-mods-here.txt` stays out of the repo.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/civilian_variety/

# Inside the mod: working notes and the sprite-index checker are development
# tools, not part of what players download.
/civilian_variety/DESIGN.md
/civilian_variety/tools/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Photoshop sources.  Kept in the working tree, deliberately not shipped: they
# are the art originals rather than anything the game reads, and the main sheet
# alone is 2.2 MB against a 240 KB export.
*.psd
